# props (A2, V-11): fix check/timestep/gran must use ONE Young's modulus source.
# youngsModulus ramps 1e7 -> 1e9 (v_, every 100). Rayleigh time ~ Y^-1/2 and Hertz
# time ~ Y^-2/5 v^-1/5, so fh/fr^0.8 must stay constant up to the (small) v^0.2
# variation. Check: check_timestep_consistency.py ts.txt
